  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strenghtening the implementation of 1972 Convention LAC Action Plan in Peru</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity will contribute to the implementation of the regional Action Plan for the  LAC region (2023-2029) in Peru. It will reinforce capacities of site managers, the development of a site managers networks  as well as focus on  addressing specific conservation, risk management and preparedness  of the Peruvian sites.  New alliances will be develop with UICN Latin America.  Overall this activity will contribute to conservation and development of WH properties in Peru.</narrative>
  </description>
